        "TileImage": "$($repository abd1c0e7-e406-43bd-9185-419029c5bf3d).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. The ICA has been targeting Providence members. We need to fight back. Your targets are Banner, Montgomery, Swan, Chamberlin, and Davenport. Montgomery, ex Navy Seal is an ICA top assassin. Banner is a brutal force to be reckoned with. Swan, a cold blooded killer is the ICA&apos;s choice for less sensitive assignments. Chamberlin, Montgomery&apos;s first lieutenant has a flawless record for the ICA. Finally, Davenport. He is the newest member of the team, but makes up for it with his accuracy.",
